{"3448830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Amy Hates Robots", "steam_appid": 3448830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4398280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/ce8b972f9e649b0e4baa68414a852d18.poster.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/ce8b972f9e649b0e4baa68414a852d18.webm?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/ce8b972f9e649b0e4baa68414a852d18.mp4?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/81325a23777e4153be5c9d83e176e469.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-roguelike, enter a post-apocalyptic world run by AI. While trying to get her TV repaired, Amy finds herself in a strange location where everything is trying to kill her, even the toasters. Team up with the mischievous and mysterious Hazel, some guy named Scott, and many more robots as you gain equipment and battle your way through an ever-shifting corporate tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/0dda2fcb844cffd1a89b4b9d43110889.avif?t=1772130445\" width=835 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/1cd22ad3a2d0db7d4c56998d79191d2e.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=285 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping you along your way is Hazel, an only <i>slightly</i> insane AI weapon with unique powers. Each upgrade is tied to one of her personality traits. Choose traits that match your play style to build the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even mix and match traits to further customize your build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/dd514f828c1ab65e229e3c14bd87b8de.avif?t=1772130445\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras_big/dd514f828c1ab65e229e3c14bd87b8de.avif?t=1772130445 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/5d6ea16ee01b41e2124a17cde9ceb3a4.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of Robolithic Technologies, where everything has come to life and is trying to kill you. Investigate the mysterious ADAM as you try to survive staplers, scissors, sales reports, and...  that other terrifying thing that begins with &quot;S&quot; (oh believe me, you'll KNOW them when you see them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fun and thrilling story as you jump, run, dodge, and do whatever it takes to not be melted into a puddle of human goo by an angry desk fan or chomped to death by a rabid stapler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/583a0ad9d6e525770805cc84804a6924.poster.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/583a0ad9d6e525770805cc84804a6924.webm?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/583a0ad9d6e525770805cc84804a6924.mp4?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/dcce08db15e764237e9c1fbd2f1e0ec2.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not <i>every</i> robot is trying to kill you, however. Some are quite friendly! Meet a quirky cast of characters who will help you along on your adventure. Like this guy. He seems friendly. He's just really concerned about your health and well-being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/fdd71981ce36b374b18e656a8a1f2555.avif?t=1772130445\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras_big/fdd71981ce36b374b18e656a8a1f2555.avif?t=1772130445 width=1560 height=494 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/ce8b972f9e649b0e4baa68414a852d18.poster.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/ce8b972f9e649b0e4baa68414a852d18.webm?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/ce8b972f9e649b0e4baa68414a852d18.mp4?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/81325a23777e4153be5c9d83e176e469.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-roguelike, enter a post-apocalyptic world run by AI. While trying to get her TV repaired, Amy finds herself in a strange location where everything is trying to kill her, even the toasters. Team up with the mischievous and mysterious Hazel, some guy named Scott, and many more robots as you gain equipment and battle your way through an ever-shifting corporate tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/0dda2fcb844cffd1a89b4b9d43110889.avif?t=1772130445\" width=835 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/1cd22ad3a2d0db7d4c56998d79191d2e.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=285 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping you along your way is Hazel, an only <i>slightly</i> insane AI weapon with unique powers. Each upgrade is tied to one of her personality traits. Choose traits that match your play style to build the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even mix and match traits to further customize your build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/dd514f828c1ab65e229e3c14bd87b8de.avif?t=1772130445\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras_big/dd514f828c1ab65e229e3c14bd87b8de.avif?t=1772130445 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/5d6ea16ee01b41e2124a17cde9ceb3a4.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of Robolithic Technologies, where everything has come to life and is trying to kill you. Investigate the mysterious ADAM as you try to survive staplers, scissors, sales reports, and...  that other terrifying thing that begins with &quot;S&quot; (oh believe me, you'll KNOW them when you see them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fun and thrilling story as you jump, run, dodge, and do whatever it takes to not be melted into a puddle of human goo by an angry desk fan or chomped to death by a rabid stapler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/583a0ad9d6e525770805cc84804a6924.poster.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/583a0ad9d6e525770805cc84804a6924.webm?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/583a0ad9d6e525770805cc84804a6924.mp4?t=1772130445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/dcce08db15e764237e9c1fbd2f1e0ec2.avif?t=1772130445\" width=1024 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not <i>every</i> robot is trying to kill you, however. Some are quite friendly! Meet a quirky cast of characters who will help you along on your adventure. Like this guy. He seems friendly. He's just really concerned about your health and well-being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448830/extras/fdd71981ce36b374b18e656a8a1f2555.avif?t=1772130445\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.s